WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.356
Adding means putting groups together.

00:03.806 --> 00:07.568
Here are three blue squares and two orange squares.

00:08.018 --> 00:13.173
Put them together and count them all. One, two, three, four, five.

00:13.623 --> 00:21.006
Three plus two equals five. The plus sign means put together. The equals sign means is the same as.

00:21.456 --> 00:27.764
Here is a quick trick. Start at the bigger number, three, and count on two more.

00:27.764 --> 00:28.631
Four, five.

00:29.081 --> 00:36.814
Try one yourself. What is two plus four? Start at the bigger number, four, and count on two.

00:36.814 --> 00:39.252
Five, six. The answer is six.
